{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00230",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 5.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "ready for you, doctor i'll stay in case you need anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.12,
      "end_seconds": 12.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "So, good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.26,
      "end_seconds": 16.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Well, I've been having very heavy periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.39,
      "end_seconds": 23.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Okay, which tablets or creams or inhalers do you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.42,
      "end_seconds": 36.14,
      "duration_seconds": 11.72,
      "text": "Thyroxine i take it 75 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid i take allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day for the gout"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 36.75,
      "end_seconds": 41.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 50 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.68,
      "end_seconds": 46.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.81,
      "end_seconds": 60.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.19,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. I take sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, maybe, twice a day for the fits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.88,
      "end_seconds": 65.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "So, is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.5,
      "end_seconds": 73.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "No, it's at home. Um, I was on levetiracetam before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.02,
      "end_seconds": 77.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "and when did that that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.72,
      "end_seconds": 82.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I've had it for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.83,
      "end_seconds": 88.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "right, how would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.09,
      "end_seconds": 104.59,
      "duration_seconds": 14.5,
      "text": "It's, It's mild, honestly. Oh, and cramping pain in the lower tummy. About cramping pain in the lower tummy, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. I've also had periods lasting longer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.23,
      "end_seconds": 114.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "A few quick ones: pain during sex, fever or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.65,
      "end_seconds": 121.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "I haven't had pain during sex, fever or weight loss, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.23,
      "end_seconds": 126.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.08,
      "end_seconds": 130.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.54,
      "end_seconds": 135.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "and your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.27,
      "end_seconds": 138.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "no, skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.66,
      "end_seconds": 144.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "alright, have you had to to have anything operated on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.66,
      "end_seconds": 152.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Yes, I had a hernia repair, about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.95,
      "end_seconds": 167.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.58,
      "end_seconds": 180.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Oh, I have an underactive thyroid, for two years. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.74,
      "end_seconds": 182.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.5,
      "end_seconds": 184.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "I have gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.35,
      "end_seconds": 188.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Okay, and what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.96,
      "end_seconds": 190.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Yes, epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.42,
      "end_seconds": 197.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Alright, gout and epilepsy, that matches what I have here. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.31,
      "end_seconds": 201.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I don't drink at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.95,
      "end_seconds": 206.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Okay, any sport or activity?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.43,
      "end_seconds": 209.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I play badminton on Sundays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.87,
      "end_seconds": 213.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Okay, are you living with family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.26,
      "end_seconds": 219.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "I stay with my daughter and her family"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.24,
      "end_seconds": 239.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Is there a a family history of anything significant?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.63,
      "end_seconds": 245.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "My father was diabetic. My father had a heart attack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.52,
      "end_seconds": 253.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.95,
      "end_seconds": 264.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "so, yes, pollen. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 271.64,
      "end_seconds": 281.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier. Heart rate 81, blood pressure 112 over 79, respiratory rate 15, temperature is 36.7 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.57,
      "end_seconds": 284.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.13,
      "end_seconds": 288.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.95,
      "end_seconds": 292.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Hold that position for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.85,
      "end_seconds": 305.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "You look a little pale."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.78,
      "end_seconds": 310.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "a little pressure here, tell me if it's tender"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.19,
      "end_seconds": 328.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "The tummy is soft, a little tender in the lower part, and there's no mass."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.17,
      "end_seconds": 343.29,
      "duration_seconds": 13.12,
      "text": "That's fine, sit up. Okay, so my impression is this: This is probably heavy periods with a cause still to find. It could also be fibroids, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 343.98,
      "end_seconds": 347.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "We've already done a pregnancy test this morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.62,
      "end_seconds": 367.44,
      "duration_seconds": 17.82,
      "text": "great, that saves time i'll start you on ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, for three months it's for possible iron deficiency and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.73,
      "end_seconds": 372.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "alright, I know what to look for"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.51,
      "end_seconds": 378.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.3,
      "end_seconds": 382.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "thanks, that was helpful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.22,
      "end_seconds": 384.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "alright, bye for now"
    }
  ]
}